  "description": "GUWDAG crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 42 21 2. Reported CIF formula moiety: C96 H86 Dy5 N14 O32 1-,2(C6 H16 N1 1+),N1 O3 1-,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.767-3.845 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.67-114.29°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy5{(S)-L}2{(S)-HL}4(NO3)2(H2O)2]·2NHEt3·NO3·H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
